The runtime SDK is preloader-android
(https://github.com/LiteLDev/preloader-android) and the launcher is
LeviLaunchroid (https://github.com/LiteLDev/LeviLaunchroid); both are
referenced for interoperability.

Use responsibly: hook/patch only binaries you are authorized to modify,
keep work to learning/personal use, and respect the game's terms of
service.
